nix-doom-emacs: Doom 3.0 Nix integration
========================================

Originally based on the Doom 2.x integration patch by Thiago Kenji Okada
(2022, "Nix integration"). Rewritten for Doom 3.0's profile system:

  * Skip upstream's profile-loader autodetection and force profile "@"
    (DOOMPROFILE), since the Nix store has no writable XDG_DATA_HOME.
  * Defer loading $DOOMPROFILELOADFILE until *after* lisp/doom.el has been
    required, so init.MAJOR.MINOR.el's `(equal doom-version ...)' check
    sees a bound symbol instead of erroring out.
  * Point `doom-data-dir' at $DOOMLOCALDIR/etc/ so the read-only Nix store
    profile dir is found at runtime.

